  "info": {
    "description": "Backend for the IToolbox Ecosystem Platform.\n\n**Modules:**\n- **Auth / Admin**: local JWT sign-in; accounts are provisioned by an admin\n- **Data Harness**: governed, read-only access to live data (sources, tables, columns, SELECT queries); nothing is copied out of the source databases\n- **Agent (BantAI)**: IToolbox's AI assistant; answers questions about the platform and from live data, citing the queries behind every claim; the model is picked per question\n\n**API route prefixes:** `/api/v1/auth` \u00b7 `/api/v1/admin` \u00b7 `/api/v1/harness` \u00b7 `/api/v1/agent`",
    "title": "IToolbox Platform API",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
